OL,3,GNEWSAMan pulled from lake died from
OL,4,Adrowning - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 19-year-old student who was taken to
OL,7,Fhospital after getting into
OL,8,Fdifficulties in a lake in
OL,9,FNottinghamshire died from drowning, an
OL,10,Finquest opening has heard.
OL,12,FPanashe Muchenje, who lived in
OL,13,FHucknall, was taken to the Queen's
OL,14,FMedical Centre in Nottingham after he
OL,15,Fhad gone swimming with friends at
OL,16,FBalderton Lake, off Heron Way in New
OL,17,FBalderton, on 28 May.
OL,19,FHe died two days later after his life
OL,20,Fsupport was switched off.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
